  - type: article
    title: "Even unimodular extremal lattices"
    authors:
      - family-names: Venkov
        given-names: Boris B.
    journal: "Trudy Mat. Inst. Steklov"
    volume: "165"
    year: 1984
    start: 43
    end: 48
    notes: >-
      The minimal shell of an extremal even unimodular lattice of dimension
      0 mod 24 is a spherical 11-design.  This is the input to dimensions 46
      and 47, recovered, and to the four claimed cross-sections 68, 69, 70
      and 71.
  - type: article
    title: "An even unimodular 72-dimensional lattice of minimum 8"
    authors:
      - family-names: Nebe
        given-names: Gabriele
    journal: "J. Reine Angew. Math."
    volume: "673"
    year: 2012
    start: 237
    end: 247
    notes: "Gamma_72, the lattice behind dimensions 70, 71 and 73-95."
